# 雷區規則索引

動到對應檔案時，下列規則會自動 attach；若沒自動出現但你判斷可能相關，主動用 Read 工具讀取全文。

| 規則檔 | 症狀關鍵字 | 對應檔案／glob |
|---|---|---|
| `modal-overlay-tiers.mdc` | 自製全螢幕遮罩當 popup／按儲存視窗還在／取消卻問尚未儲存 | 全站（alwaysApply） |
| `traditional-chinese.mdc` | 溝通語言 | 全站（alwaysApply） |
| `ai-grading-pipeline-invariants.mdc` | AI 批改拖垮登入／延遲重試風暴／雙 webhook／沒勾AI批改卻照樣送 | `process-audio-ai/**`, `feature-ai-backfill.js`, `task-script-resolver.js`, `store-assignment-builder.js` |
| `assignment-id-uuid-invariant.mdc` | assignment id 混血 bigint/uuid | `migrations/**`, `api.js`, `store-assignment-builder.js` |
| `drive-folder-upload-invariants.mdc` | 學生繳交跑進 01_Class_Resources／多檔上傳中途失敗整批丟 | `gas/Code.gs`, `api.js`, `api-gas-service.js`, `feature-student-timeline.js` |
| `exam-available-count-invariant.mdc` | 可用題顯示 ~20／— 老問題／必考題號（include_nums）被誤當限縮用、範圍算成 0 | `feature-exam-job.js`, `feature-timeline.js`, `quiz-paper-builder.js` |
| `material-snapshot-refs-invariant.mdc` | Snapshot 存檔後只剩 A／第二冊不進 snap | `store-assignment-builder.js`, `feature-timeline.js`, `ui-timeline-templates.js` |
| `page-refresh-perf-invariant.mdc` | 重整卡頓／隱藏分頁搶跑重活 | `ui-core.js`, `store.js`, `feature-student-timeline.js`, `ui-student-timeline-templates.js` |
| `skeleton-unit-invariant.mdc` | 錄音「單元骨架」（E 選項）先建結構後補文稿／AI 依 index 抓稿風險；base 範圍手動覆寫會被路徑異動自動蓋掉的坑 | `ui-timeline-templates.js`, `feature-timeline.js`, `store-assignment-builder.js`, `process-audio-ai/**` |
| `assignment-title-auto-inherit-invariant.mdc` | 任務／範圍群組標題卡死在舊值（例：怎麼改 base 範圍標題都還是 Unit 10） | `ui-timeline-templates.js`, `feature-timeline.js`, `store-assignment-builder.js` |
| `material-publish-setup-format.mdc` | 教材發布 `_Setup` 合併格式／同活頁多區塊誤填 LAST／last_row_column 沒對齊實際欄位 | `material_templates/**` |
| `quiz-accepted-answers-invariant.mdc` | 考試批改：多標準答案改錯層／全班重批漏改或誤改／ModalOverlay 重繪把 state 清空 | `quiz-paper-builder.js`, `feature-exam-review.js`, `api-quiz-review.js`, `feature-student-quiz.js` |
| `script-collector-paste-windows-invariant.mdc` | C 貼上多視窗（paste_windows）沒同步進 original_script／collector 誤回寫原始作業 | `ui-timeline-templates.js`, `feature-timeline.js`, `store-assignment-builder.js`, `feature-script-collector.js` |
| `exam-wrong-retake-invariant.mdc` | 重考錯題（僅一次）判定範圍漂移／合併正確率分母算錯／重考按鈕找不到入口 | `feature-exam-job.js`, `feature-exam-review.js`, `feature-student-quiz.js`, `ui-student-timeline-templates.js` |
